 the movements that will happen when the balls collide and plan your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master conveyor belt mechanics that will move your ball in certain directions. These conveyor belt boxes have their own timelines, so you will have to carefully plan how they affect your sequence of actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/606045c284d6fca0d45f7518665c4d00.poster.avif?t=1753173946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/606045c284d6fca0d45f7518665c4d00.webm?t=1753173946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/606045c284d6fca0d45f7518665c4d00.mp4?t=1753173946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy 200+ Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy more than 200+ levels where you will be tested. Line Time doesn\u2019t feature filler levels: once you learn the basic mechanics, you will face real challenges immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/1bcb8cc34b695032d3091cf79e08523f.poster.avif?t=1753173946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/1bcb8cc34b695032d3091cf79e08523f.webm?t=1753173946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861120/extras/1bcb8cc34b695032d3091cf79e08523f.mp4?t=1753173946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
